  <p id="c-liangshu-050-xiejiqing-family-intro:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiejiqing-family-intro:p001:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAB">謝幾卿</persName>，陳郡陽夏人。曾祖<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiejiqing-family-intro:p001:m0012" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAA">靈運</persName>，宋臨川內史；父<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiejiqing-family-intro:p001:m0022" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">超宗</persName>，齊黃門郎；並有重名於前代。</p>
